# Project policy / 项目说明

这是以个人实验为主的分享项目。作者不承诺维护、错误修复、更新、需求处理、回复或接收贡献。欢迎在相应许可范围内自行研究或分叉；提交问题不形成服务承诺。公开材料不要包含 ADB 密钥、设备序列号、IP、账号、个人路径或未经授权的固件/字体。

This is a shared personal experiment. Maintenance, fixes, updates, requests, responses and contribution acceptance are not promised. Study/fork within the applicable licenses. A submission does not create a support commitment. Keep keys, device identifiers, addresses, accounts, personal paths and unauthorized firmware/fonts out of public material.

## AI 工具 / AI tools

本项目的开发、调试与文档整理使用了 AI 工具。生成内容可能有误，功能和测试范围以项目记录为准。

AI tools assisted development, debugging and documentation. Generated content may contain errors; project records define the functionality and tested scope.
